+# Plan: JSON Patch
+
+Standard: RFC 6902 §3–§5, RFC 6901 §3–§4 (see spec.md).
+
+## Approach
+- Parse pointers into tokens with a shared `parseTokens` (refactored out of `resolvePointer`).
+- `applyPatch` deep-clones the document (own-property clone, safe for `__proto__`), applies operations to the clone, returns it. Values from the patch are cloned when inserted. Atomicity comes from working on the clone.
+- `PatchError` class with `code`.
+
+## Constitution Check
+- I: RFC 6902 sections named; atomicity, prefix rule, `-` handling implemented per standard. PASS
+- II: no dependencies. PASS
+- III: tests in `test/patch.test.ts` written and run failing first. PASS
+- IV: no mutation, prototype-safe, typed errors. PASS
+- V: exported from `src/index.ts`, doc comments, strict TS, no `any`. PASS
+- VI: single function plus small helpers. PASS
